WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:09.410
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
03:09.680 --> 03:11.120
Dad.

3
03:11.960 --> 03:14.200
Please take care of Grandma for me.

4
03:14.280 --> 03:15.320
PREVIOUSLY

5
03:15.400 --> 03:19.440
Whatever happens, you have to accept it and fight through it.

6
03:19.520 --> 03:22.760
I'll allow you to stay in this house.

7
03:22.840 --> 03:24.920
But only because you are Hathaya's mother.

8
03:25.000 --> 03:26.760
I only need to use it once

9
03:26.840 --> 03:30.520
to get them thrown out of this house.

10
03:31.840 --> 03:33.560
What are you doing?

11
03:47.440 --> 03:48.600
What was that?

12
03:49.600 --> 03:52.080
Did Chayanee say something that upset you?

13
03:53.080 --> 03:54.720
She's jealous of me.

14
03:55.800 --> 03:57.760
She thinks I'm stealing Raiwin.

15
03:59.880 --> 04:01.000
And…

16
04:02.440 --> 04:05.360
Are you?

17
04:08.920 --> 04:12.200
Then if you're not, there's nothing to worry about.

18
04:13.040 --> 04:15.080
I still feel bad about it.

19
04:16.040 --> 04:17.600
You can't care what everyone thinks.

20
04:19.800 --> 04:22.040
If you carry everyone's feelings around with you,

21
04:23.080 --> 04:25.240
when are you ever going to be happy?

22
04:29.400 --> 04:31.560
If you're going to care about someone…

23
04:33.400 --> 04:36.640
you could care about the people

24
04:37.360 --> 04:39.000
close to you.

25
04:44.520 --> 04:46.080
You're right.

26
04:47.320 --> 04:50.040
I should pay more attention to Grandpa and Mom.

27
04:55.360 --> 04:56.520
Right.

28
04:57.480 --> 05:01.480
Although I think there might be

29
05:02.560 --> 05:05.840
another good person close to you

30
05:05.920 --> 05:08.400
who deserves some attention too.

31
05:12.120 --> 05:13.800
Thank you so much.

32
05:14.880 --> 05:17.040
I'll pay more attention to the workers too.

33
05:35.000 --> 05:36.440
You really didn't think of me?

34
05:53.400 --> 05:54.640
Why did you call me?

35
05:58.920 --> 06:00.200
What was that for?

36
06:02.720 --> 06:05.120
-Chayanee. -Don't raise your voice at me.

37
06:06.280 --> 06:10.320
I'm knocking some sense into you. If I call for you,

38
06:10.400 --> 06:12.000
you come to me immediately.

39
06:12.080 --> 06:14.400
Don't make me call you twice. You're embarrassing me.

40
06:14.480 --> 06:16.480
And you think I'm not embarrassed?

41
06:16.560 --> 06:19.280
You shouted my name like I was your servant.

42
06:19.360 --> 06:21.280
You're not my servant.

43
06:21.840 --> 06:24.680
But you belong to me. Not Hathaya.

44
06:25.320 --> 06:26.800
What does she have to do with this?

45
06:27.600 --> 06:29.320
I'm not blind.

46
06:30.560 --> 06:32.760
I saw you deliberately holding her hand.

47
06:32.840 --> 06:36.040
If I'd shown up a little later, you'd have dragged her off somewhere.

48
06:37.720 --> 06:39.320
We were only talking.

49
06:40.080 --> 06:42.800
I was asking her to help campaign for me.

50
06:42.880 --> 06:46.440
You already have me. I can do that job.

51
06:46.960 --> 06:48.920
You don't need that parasite.

52
06:50.280 --> 06:53.840
From now on, wherever you go and whatever you do, you tell me.

53
06:53.920 --> 06:55.440
Stay where I can keep an eye on you.

54
06:59.800 --> 07:03.840
Am I your boyfriend or your prisoner?

55
07:16.600 --> 07:18.200
If you were my prisoner,

56
07:20.280 --> 07:24.160
I wouldn't even let you question me.

57
07:27.160 --> 07:30.000
Don't forget what you promised me.

58
07:31.120 --> 07:33.200
You said you wouldn't hurt me again.

59
07:38.320 --> 07:39.880
I'm going to touch up my makeup.

60
07:40.880 --> 07:42.360
You're coming to the shrine with me.

61
07:53.160 --> 07:54.000
Ramil.

62
08:04.080 --> 08:07.320
Ramil, you don't deserve this.

63
08:15.240 --> 08:17.880
Madam. Madam. Madam.

64
08:17.960 --> 08:20.000
"Madam, Madam, Madam."

65
08:20.080 --> 08:23.040
Madam, let me speak first.

66
08:23.120 --> 08:26.200
You yell for me all day long. What is it now?

67
08:26.280 --> 08:29.200
It's your rival.

68
08:29.280 --> 08:31.720
She's putting on a show, acting like some heroine

69
08:31.800 --> 08:33.919
in the middle of a lavender field.

70
08:34.000 --> 08:36.159
A lavender field?

71
08:36.240 --> 08:38.679
Wait. Since when do we have a lavender field here?

72
08:38.760 --> 08:42.039
Oh, come on, madam. It's a figure of speech.

73
08:42.559 --> 08:44.680
She's in the rose garden,

74
08:44.760 --> 08:47.360
acting like the star of some drama.

75
08:47.440 --> 08:50.720
-Really? -Yes. I'll show you. Come on.

76
08:55.320 --> 08:56.200
Alright.

77
08:58.920 --> 08:59.960
Pong.

78
09:02.200 --> 09:03.040
Pong.

79
09:04.200 --> 09:06.920
Madam, I think he might be asleep.

80
09:09.040 --> 09:12.160
I'll step up and wake him.

81
09:12.240 --> 09:13.600
Absolutely not.

82
09:13.680 --> 09:15.120
Go find something else to do. Go.

83
09:15.200 --> 09:17.600
I'm free today. I have nothing to do.

84
09:22.600 --> 09:24.040
I just remembered.

85
09:24.120 --> 09:26.640
I haven't cleaned the bedrooms yet. I should go do that.

86
09:26.720 --> 09:28.080
-Go. -Yes, madam.

87
09:28.680 --> 09:31.080
-Okay… -Hurry.

88
09:40.600 --> 09:41.800
So possessive.

89
09:46.920 --> 09:48.200
Why are you still here?

90
09:48.280 --> 09:49.440
I'm going.

91
09:54.240 --> 09:55.200
Pong.

92
09:59.360 --> 10:00.360
Pong.

93
10:12.800 --> 10:14.200
Pong!

94
10:14.280 --> 10:15.160
It's me.

95
10:18.640 --> 10:19.720
Sorry.

96
10:20.640 --> 10:24.360
I thought someone dangerous had broken in.

97
10:26.120 --> 10:29.440
Why don't you put some clothes on?

98
10:30.040 --> 10:32.000
I have an urgent job for you.

99
10:37.040 --> 10:38.800
If it's that urgent,

100
10:39.400 --> 10:41.520
just tell me now. I'm listening.

101
10:43.800 --> 10:46.600
I want you to get close to Hathai,

102
10:46.680 --> 10:48.200
Hathaya's mother,

103
10:48.720 --> 10:51.520
and lure her into your trap.

104
10:52.440 --> 10:53.880
You picked the right man for it.

105
10:57.800 --> 11:00.360
Don't mess this up like you did at the construction site.

106
11:00.440 --> 11:03.600
Otherwise, I won't keep you around.

107
11:04.440 --> 11:05.840
I won't mess up again.

108
11:08.360 --> 11:10.600
You know I'm good at getting close

109
11:13.800 --> 11:14.680
to women.

110
11:30.680 --> 11:31.600
Hey.

111
11:32.680 --> 11:35.600
It's your day off. You came all the way here to see me.

112
11:35.680 --> 11:37.080
Is something wrong?

113
11:37.640 --> 11:39.680
You could've just called.

114
11:40.440 --> 11:41.520
I wanted to see you.

115
11:46.840 --> 11:50.440
I mean there's something important I need to discuss with you in person.

116
11:51.440 --> 11:52.480
Oh.

117
11:53.960 --> 11:55.040
What is it?

118
11:56.320 --> 11:59.600
Ask Hathaya to help campaign for me.

119
11:59.680 --> 12:02.480
I think you should ask Hathaya yourself.

120
12:02.560 --> 12:04.800
But she listens to you.

121
12:05.480 --> 12:09.720
Help me this once. Consider it repayment for the favor I did for you.

122
12:10.400 --> 12:12.760
Raiwin asked me to talk to you.

123
12:14.120 --> 12:15.360
He wants your help campaigning.

124
12:18.640 --> 12:21.440
And what do you think?

125
12:22.040 --> 12:23.040
Hm.

126
12:24.480 --> 12:26.160
I want you

127
12:27.680 --> 12:28.800
to help him.

128
12:31.160 --> 12:33.720
Why do you want to help him

129
12:33.800 --> 12:35.920
after the way he's treated you?

130
12:36.680 --> 12:38.800
Raiwin may seem selfish.

131
12:40.120 --> 12:41.160
But a lot of that

132
12:41.840 --> 12:43.560
comes from how his father controlled him.

133
12:45.440 --> 12:48.600
I think Raiwin wants a chance to be himself too.

134
12:48.680 --> 12:50.560
And up until now,

135
12:50.640 --> 12:52.800
he's never really accomplished anything on his own.

136
12:54.160 --> 12:55.400
And there's something else.

137
12:55.480 --> 12:57.960
If Papang ever learns

138
12:58.840 --> 13:00.960
that Raiwin is his real father,

139
13:01.840 --> 13:04.000
I want him to be proud of Raiwin.

140
13:12.280 --> 13:15.360
I'm ready, sweetheart. Shall we go?

141
13:15.960 --> 13:19.240
Mom. I need to go take care of something with Ramil.

142
13:21.040 --> 13:24.440
Can you wait until I get back? Then I'll take you shopping.

143
13:26.440 --> 13:29.080
It's okay. Don't worry about me.

144
13:29.160 --> 13:31.440
I used to live here. I can go by myself.

145
13:32.040 --> 13:35.960
Then at least let Aunt Ann go with you. I worry about you.

146
13:37.800 --> 13:38.680
Alright.

147
13:40.840 --> 13:42.240
Take care of my daughter for me.

148
13:44.960 --> 13:46.280
I will.

149
13:49.200 --> 13:50.360
I'm going now, Mom.

150
13:50.440 --> 13:51.880
Take care.

151
14:04.480 --> 14:05.560
Ann?

152
14:06.680 --> 14:07.600
Ann?

153
14:08.320 --> 14:10.040
Ann isn't here.

154
14:10.120 --> 14:12.720
Father wanted chive dumplings from down the street.

155
14:13.840 --> 14:14.760
What do you want?

156
14:15.360 --> 14:17.800
I'm going out. I was going to ask Ann to come with me.

157
14:19.680 --> 14:22.160
I'm free. Want me to go with you?

158
14:24.400 --> 14:27.240
I'm free too. I'd be happy to look after you, Ms. Hathai.

159
14:27.320 --> 14:28.720
Thank you,

160
14:29.560 --> 14:32.040
but there's no need. I can go by myself.

161
14:33.720 --> 14:37.400
There are all kinds of scammers out there these days.

162
14:38.080 --> 14:39.400
Be careful.

163
14:53.200 --> 14:56.560
Madam, what did you plan with Pong?

164
14:58.560 --> 14:59.400
You want to know?

165
14:59.480 --> 15:00.680
Yes.

166
15:02.760 --> 15:05.200
Then just wait for the good news.

167
15:05.280 --> 15:08.760
Madam. Don't keep secrets from me. We're on the same side.

168
15:26.960 --> 15:30.320
You're just helping me hand out flyers. You didn't have to dress up.

169
15:32.600 --> 15:34.240
If we dress normally,

170
15:34.320 --> 15:37.560
we'll look poor. We need to look rich.

171
15:37.640 --> 15:40.120
Rich enough that people believe they can rely on us.

172
15:41.280 --> 15:45.080
I'm not here to sell wealth. I'm here to sell policies.

173
15:45.680 --> 15:48.480
Listen, Raiwin. Your father

174
15:48.560 --> 15:51.000
came up with good policies too.

175
15:51.080 --> 15:54.080
And what good does

176
15:54.160 --> 15:57.480
flaunting wealth do? Does that really win people over?

177
15:57.560 --> 15:59.720
People want a good person representing them.

178
15:59.800 --> 16:03.560
Listen, brand-new politician.

179
16:04.200 --> 16:07.640
What do people get from having a good person as their leader?

180
16:08.240 --> 16:10.360
They get a good person who develops the community.

181
16:10.440 --> 16:14.120
And if the community develops, what do the villagers personally get?

182
16:15.560 --> 16:17.800
But if they get a wealthy leader,

183
16:17.880 --> 16:21.000
then when they're in trouble, they have someone rich to depend on.

184
16:21.600 --> 16:23.360
That's how parasites are.

185
16:23.440 --> 16:25.960
They want to attach themselves to rich people.

186
16:26.040 --> 16:27.520
Thai-style democracy.

187
16:28.120 --> 16:30.400
You look down on the locals too much.

188
16:33.320 --> 16:37.600
When our country actually has equality,

189
16:37.680 --> 16:40.000
then you can come talk to me about democracy.

190
16:40.880 --> 16:42.040
Come on.

191
16:43.760 --> 16:44.640
Put your jacket on.

192
16:56.640 --> 16:58.800
Hello. Hello.

193
16:58.880 --> 17:00.480
Hello. I'm Raiwin.

194
17:00.560 --> 17:01.720
Please vote number one.

195
17:01.800 --> 17:03.120
Yes.

196
17:03.200 --> 17:04.800
Aw.

197
17:04.880 --> 17:06.880
So cute.

198
17:06.960 --> 17:08.920
Can I hold you?

199
17:09.000 --> 17:11.000
-Thank you. -Hello.

200
17:11.079 --> 17:12.520
Is this for me?

201
17:12.599 --> 17:14.440
Hello.

202
17:14.520 --> 17:15.920
Hold this for me.

203
17:16.640 --> 17:19.760
NUMBER 1 RAIWIN TRAIPONGRATCHATA

204
17:19.839 --> 17:20.720
Come on.

205
17:21.520 --> 17:23.880
That way.

206
17:23.960 --> 17:25.440
So cute.

207
17:28.359 --> 17:30.280
-Isn't he adorable? -Very.

208
17:30.360 --> 17:31.840
Take a picture for me.

209
17:32.360 --> 17:33.520
Sure.

210
17:35.520 --> 17:37.320
-Ready? -Look at the camera.

211
17:37.400 --> 17:40.320
One, two, three.

212
17:40.400 --> 17:43.240
Come get in the picture too. Come on.

213
17:44.360 --> 17:45.800
There!

214
17:45.880 --> 17:46.960
Look at the camera. Smile.

215
17:47.040 --> 17:49.440
One, two, three.

216
17:50.040 --> 17:50.960
Okay.

217
17:51.040 --> 17:53.760
Raiwin, if we ever have a child,

218
17:53.840 --> 17:55.480
our baby has to be this cute.

219
17:58.320 --> 18:01.000
-Okay. -Hathaya is here too. Let's take pictures.

220
18:01.080 --> 18:04.360
-Let's go take pictures with her. -One, two, three.

221
18:04.440 --> 18:05.800
Beautiful.

222
18:08.040 --> 18:09.480
Wait.

223
18:10.000 --> 18:12.120
Excuse us.

224
18:14.200 --> 18:17.040
Please support candidate number one, Mr. Raiwin.

225
18:17.120 --> 18:18.440
Please support him.

226
18:18.520 --> 18:20.640
-Please vote for him. -Thank you very much.

227
18:20.720 --> 18:22.640
-Hello. -Hello.

228
18:22.720 --> 18:24.360
-Hello. -Hello.

229
18:24.440 --> 18:26.080
One, two, three.

230
18:27.440 --> 18:29.240
-Very nice. -Thank you.

231
18:29.320 --> 18:31.560
Please support us. Vote for Raiwin, number one.

232
18:31.640 --> 18:32.760
Thank you very much.

233
18:35.760 --> 18:36.600
What's this?

234
18:36.680 --> 18:37.760
He gave it to me.

235
18:38.720 --> 18:39.560
Why are you here?

236
18:40.160 --> 18:41.920
I brought Hathaya here.

237
18:43.280 --> 18:46.920
I told you not to have Hathaya campaign for you.

238
18:47.000 --> 18:48.360
I brought her myself.

239
18:48.440 --> 18:49.720
What's this to do with you?

240
18:49.800 --> 18:50.840
Oh?

241
18:50.920 --> 18:54.680
Is there a rule against a younger brother helping his older brother campaign?

242
18:54.760 --> 18:56.880
Come on, Chayanee.

243
18:57.640 --> 18:59.680
Don't let jealousy ruin the campaign.

244
19:00.480 --> 19:01.320
Look around.

245
19:01.400 --> 19:02.880
Everyone is watching.

246
19:04.680 --> 19:06.400
Why don't we put on

247
19:06.480 --> 19:08.640
a united family front?

248
19:08.720 --> 19:09.560
It'll help Raiwin.

249
19:09.640 --> 19:12.080
Come on over. Please, come over here.

250
19:12.160 --> 19:14.560
Come on. Right here.

251
19:14.640 --> 19:16.360
Please come. Here.

252
19:16.440 --> 19:19.000
We'll take some pictures with Hathaya too.

253
19:19.080 --> 19:20.960
What a lucky day.

254
19:21.040 --> 19:23.240
Both of my sons are here together.

255
19:23.320 --> 19:25.280
We're family. We're number one.

256
19:25.880 --> 19:28.600
Let's all take a picture together. Come here.

257
19:28.680 --> 19:30.720
Miss Chayanee, stand in the middle.

258
19:30.800 --> 19:32.680
Son, stand right beside her. Our future Chief.

259
19:32.760 --> 19:35.000
Everyone, come take pictures with us.

260
19:35.600 --> 19:37.280
Look at the camera.

261
19:37.360 --> 19:39.520
Smile. Everyone smile.

262
19:39.600 --> 19:42.480
We're team number one. Smile.

263
19:42.560 --> 19:43.680
Number one.

264
19:52.360 --> 19:55.040
Thanks for helping my son.

265
19:55.120 --> 19:58.640
Though I probably don't even need to thank you.

266
19:58.720 --> 20:01.760
-Someone like you -Number one!

267
20:01.840 --> 20:04.960
owes me plenty anyway.

268
20:06.080 --> 20:07.240
Wow, Uncle.

269
20:07.320 --> 20:10.000
You'd look a lot better if you just kept quiet.

270
20:11.560 --> 20:12.520
Ramil.

271
20:12.600 --> 20:15.040
Former Subdistrict Chief, control yourself.

272
20:15.120 --> 20:18.040
We're in public. It won't look good.

273
20:18.640 --> 20:21.040
And you really don't have to thank me.

274
20:21.120 --> 20:23.640
I'm doing this for Raiwin and Papang.

275
20:24.200 --> 20:26.480
I'm not doing a single thing for you.

276
20:28.000 --> 20:29.000
Ramil.

277
20:32.600 --> 20:35.080
Uncle, I hate those two.

278
20:35.160 --> 20:37.120
Can you make them leave?

279
20:38.200 --> 20:40.480
Chayanee, calm down.

280
20:41.640 --> 20:44.120
If we throw them out now, it won't be good for Raiwin.

281
20:46.320 --> 20:50.440
You need to be patient.

282
20:50.520 --> 20:52.400
That woman may be

283
20:52.480 --> 20:55.360
the darling of the grassroots,

284
20:57.240 --> 20:59.360
but you're

285
21:01.240 --> 21:02.720
Raiwin's sweetheart.

286
21:05.200 --> 21:06.600
And you're the real one.

287
21:10.360 --> 21:14.160
Vote number one. Please support us.

288
21:14.240 --> 21:16.000
Vote number one.

289
21:16.080 --> 21:18.800
Yes. Please vote number one.

290
21:18.880 --> 21:21.280
-Please vote number one. -Hello.

291
21:21.360 --> 21:24.080
Number one.

292
21:24.160 --> 21:25.440
Number one.

293
21:33.320 --> 21:36.080
No woman is interested in a poor man, madam.

294
21:36.600 --> 21:38.080
They're all chasing appearances.

295
21:38.160 --> 21:39.520
So what do you want me to do?

296
21:39.600 --> 21:43.200
You need to get me clothes and accessories that fit the part I'm playing.

297
21:46.360 --> 21:47.440
And what part is that?

298
21:48.040 --> 21:50.200
A wealthy tycoon who owns a global travel agency.

299
21:57.440 --> 22:00.840
Minister? Yes, sir.

300
22:01.840 --> 22:04.280
Of course. Whatever you need.

301
22:04.360 --> 22:06.000
Where would you like to go this time?

302
22:06.080 --> 22:08.560
Would you like to follow the Olympic trail

303
22:08.640 --> 22:12.560
in France or go skiing in Switzerland?

304
22:12.640 --> 22:14.800
Of course. The snow is perfect right now.

305
22:15.840 --> 22:18.880
Absolutely. I'd be delighted.

306
22:19.720 --> 22:21.520
Yes, sir.

307
22:23.080 --> 22:26.360
Yes. No problem at all.

308
22:26.440 --> 22:28.880
A hundred thousand, a million,

309
22:29.480 --> 22:31.440
that's nothing. Anything for you, sir.

310
22:32.880 --> 22:35.160
Yes, sir.

311
22:36.280 --> 22:37.120
Sir--

312
23:08.000 --> 23:10.960
Use this to buy clothes that fit the role.

313
23:13.400 --> 23:16.000
How about some money for supporting actors too, madam?

314
23:16.880 --> 23:18.960
Why do you need anyone else?

315
23:19.040 --> 23:22.360
If you want to impress a woman, you need to create a hero moment.

316
23:47.040 --> 23:48.000
Help. Help me.

317
23:48.080 --> 23:49.960
-My purse. My purse. -I'll get it back.

318
23:50.040 --> 23:52.240
-Help. -Stop. I said stop!

319
23:52.320 --> 23:54.640
Somebody help. A thief stole my purse.

320
23:54.720 --> 23:56.440
I told you to stop. Stop.

321
23:56.960 --> 23:59.000
Daeng. I told you to stop.

322
23:59.080 --> 24:01.960
Where the hell are you going? I'm exhausted. Give it here.

323
24:02.040 --> 24:03.320
She's coming.

324
24:03.400 --> 24:04.560
Help.

325
24:04.640 --> 24:07.080
-Punch me. -Somebody help.

326
24:07.160 --> 24:09.600
You didn't have to hit me that hard. My turn.

327
24:09.680 --> 24:11.280
Hey!

328
24:11.360 --> 24:13.400
Don't run away.

329
24:13.480 --> 24:14.600
Be careful.

330
24:15.440 --> 24:17.320
Here's your purse.

331
24:17.400 --> 24:18.600
-Thank you. -Wait here.

332
24:18.680 --> 24:20.480
I'm going after him.

333
24:20.560 --> 24:22.080
Be careful.

334
24:22.160 --> 24:23.720
-Stop! -Help!

335
24:23.800 --> 24:26.240
-Somebody help. There's a thief. -Stop!

336
24:33.040 --> 24:34.360
Is it too hot?

337
24:34.440 --> 24:36.120
-I'm good, totally fine. -Can I have one?

338
24:36.200 --> 24:37.080
Yeah.

339
24:37.600 --> 24:39.000
-Hello. -Hello.

340
24:39.080 --> 24:41.400
Please support candidate number one.

341
24:41.480 --> 24:42.960
-Hello. -Please support us.

342
24:43.040 --> 24:44.840
-Thank you. -How much?

343
24:46.720 --> 24:48.960
The polling place is just outside the village.

344
24:49.040 --> 24:51.240
It shouldn't cost much to get there.

345
24:51.320 --> 24:54.120
Going out to vote still costs money.

346
24:54.200 --> 24:56.160
There should at least be pocket money.

347
24:56.240 --> 24:58.480
-Right? -Right. We need some cash.

348
24:58.560 --> 25:01.240
Let's be frank. Other candidates pay 500.

349
25:01.320 --> 25:03.040
How much can you offer?

350
25:03.120 --> 25:05.800
Let's just see who pays the most.

351
25:05.880 --> 25:08.080
You know that's illegal.

352
25:08.160 --> 25:10.760
I'd rather you look at the policies.

353
25:11.280 --> 25:13.960
See which candidate can actually improve your lives.

354
25:14.040 --> 25:17.120
Waste of time. The former subdistrict chief said the same thing.

355
25:17.640 --> 25:19.680
Never delivered on any of it. Empty promises.

356
25:19.760 --> 25:21.600
Exactly. We've heard it all before.

357
25:23.640 --> 25:25.800
But Raiwin isn't

358
25:25.880 --> 25:27.160
-a politician-- -Just go.

359
25:27.240 --> 25:29.160
Save it. You're wasting my time.

360
25:29.760 --> 25:30.840
Come on. Forget it.

361
25:31.360 --> 25:34.120
Let's go over there. People are waiting for you.

362
25:34.760 --> 25:35.960
-Waste of time. -Come.

363
25:36.920 --> 25:38.040
Everyone's the same.

364
25:49.560 --> 25:50.440
Hathaya.

365
25:55.720 --> 25:58.120
If you don't like the policies, that's fine.

366
25:58.200 --> 26:01.440
Just give the flyers back. Don't tear them up and litter.

367
26:02.000 --> 26:04.640
Everyone is campaigning to keep the community clean.

368
26:05.200 --> 26:08.080
Paper like this can clog the drains.

369
26:08.160 --> 26:11.200
Guys. She's angry just because we said we won't vote for her guy.

370
26:11.280 --> 26:14.280
I'm not angry because you won't vote for the candidate I support.

371
26:14.360 --> 26:16.000
It's because you're selling your voices.

372
26:16.080 --> 26:18.240
We're not selling them.

373
26:18.320 --> 26:21.040
We still have our voices. And they're pretty loud, too.

374
26:21.120 --> 26:22.880
Come on, everyone. Let's hear your voices.

375
26:25.000 --> 26:27.560
You complain that politicians are corrupt,

376
26:27.640 --> 26:30.320
but you're helping create those corrupt politicians.

377
26:30.960 --> 26:33.520
You even bargain over who pays more and who pays less.

378
26:33.600 --> 26:36.360
In the end, you're the ones benefiting from it.

379
26:36.440 --> 26:39.400
We get 500 or 600 baht. That barely pays for snacks and drinks.

380
26:40.000 --> 26:43.320
But when politicians get into office, they invent projects

381
26:43.400 --> 26:44.560
and pocket millions.

382
26:46.240 --> 26:47.880
I used to work as a contractor.

383
26:48.400 --> 26:51.320
Name one place in this country where there aren't kickbacks.

384
26:51.400 --> 26:55.000
Once they're in office, they come up with projects. Clock towers.

385
26:55.080 --> 26:58.400
Roads. Streetlights. They tear things down, build them again,

386
26:58.480 --> 27:00.080
and take kickbacks every step of the way.

387
27:00.160 --> 27:04.400
You know corrupt politicians want to make back what they spent getting elected.

388
27:05.880 --> 27:08.040
Then we can't allow parasitic politicians

389
27:08.120 --> 27:09.480
to take our tax money.

390
27:10.560 --> 27:12.880
And the reason you complain about politicians

391
27:12.960 --> 27:15.080
is because you hate seeing them steal.

392
27:15.680 --> 27:17.560
If you don't want them stealing,

393
27:18.160 --> 27:21.640
then you can't sell your vote either. You can't break the law.

394
27:21.720 --> 27:23.680
Everything has to start with us.

395
27:23.760 --> 27:26.280
How am I supposed to know this candidate won't steal?

396
27:30.440 --> 27:31.680
Raiwin.

397
27:32.280 --> 27:35.440
Can you promise everyone here

398
27:35.520 --> 27:37.920
that you won't buy a single vote?

399
27:43.160 --> 27:44.840
There's no need for promises.

400
27:44.920 --> 27:46.720
My son, your future subdistrict chief,

401
27:47.440 --> 27:50.520
-is a generous and sincere man. -I promise.

402
27:57.960 --> 28:00.440
I'll run an honest campaign.

403
28:01.680 --> 28:04.000
And I promise that if I'm elected,

404
28:04.640 --> 28:06.800
I'll work as hard as I can.

405
28:07.480 --> 28:09.080
I will not engage in corruption.

406
28:11.160 --> 28:12.320
Please support number one.

407
28:12.400 --> 28:14.440
Number one.

408
28:14.520 --> 28:17.680
Number one.

409
28:17.760 --> 28:20.360
Number one.

410
28:21.960 --> 28:25.040
Number one.

411
28:25.120 --> 28:27.840
-Please vote number one. -Thank you.

412
28:27.920 --> 28:29.040
Thank you.

413
28:30.600 --> 28:33.280
I'm out of flyers. Next time

414
28:33.360 --> 28:35.160
you should bring a lot more.

415
28:35.920 --> 28:40.240
That's great. Then more people can read my policies and ideas.

416
28:40.320 --> 28:43.280
Thanks, Ramil. And thank you, Hathaya.

417
28:44.280 --> 28:46.000
I'm happy to help.

418
28:46.080 --> 28:48.480
But please keep the promise you made.

419
28:48.560 --> 28:50.200
If you break your word,

420
28:51.160 --> 28:53.240
the two of us will be on opposite sides.

421
28:55.040 --> 28:57.120
Are you threatening Raiwin?

422
28:57.920 --> 29:01.080
I'm not threatening him. I mean it sincerely.

423
29:01.680 --> 29:05.320
I agreed to campaign for him because I want to see clean politics.

424
29:18.680 --> 29:19.560
Hey.

425
29:20.080 --> 29:22.960
I think I'll stop by one more place and hand out flyers.

426
29:24.000 --> 29:26.480
No. I'm tired. I want to go home.

427
29:28.560 --> 29:31.840
Okay. Let's go eat.

428
29:53.040 --> 29:54.480
NUMBER 2 KRITSADA SIDEE

429
30:01.120 --> 30:02.600
I spoke with the police.

430
30:02.680 --> 30:05.040
They promised they'll catch the thief.

431
30:06.440 --> 30:08.720
It's really okay. I got my purse back,

432
30:08.800 --> 30:10.560
and all the money's there. That's enough.

433
30:11.160 --> 30:14.800
No. I still need to coordinate with the police and make sure they catch him.

434
30:15.320 --> 30:18.080
If criminals go unpunished, everyone is in danger.

435
30:18.160 --> 30:20.120
Thank you so much.

436
30:20.200 --> 30:22.280
You got hurt because of me.

437
30:22.360 --> 30:24.760
It was nothing. I was happy to help.

438
30:26.200 --> 30:29.200
I need to go.

439
30:29.280 --> 30:33.080
I have to take the minister's family overseas.

440
30:34.240 --> 30:35.200
Excuse me.

441
30:35.280 --> 30:36.120
Alright.

442
30:44.120 --> 30:45.280
I'm really leaving now.

443
30:45.880 --> 30:48.360
-Thank you again. -Of course.

444
30:51.080 --> 30:52.600
Stop me, damn it.

445
30:54.120 --> 30:58.080
Come on. One, two, three--

446
30:58.160 --> 30:59.360
Excuse me.

447
31:02.160 --> 31:03.080
Yes?

448
31:08.360 --> 31:09.440
Well,

449
31:10.240 --> 31:11.800
you helped me,

450
31:12.600 --> 31:14.440
and I still don't even know your name.

451
31:14.520 --> 31:16.280
You can call me Yai.

452
31:17.480 --> 31:19.040
All right, Yai.

453
31:21.800 --> 31:25.080
If I get the chance,

454
31:25.160 --> 31:28.120
I'd like to treat you to a meal to thank you for helping me.

455
31:29.120 --> 31:32.120
Could we exchange contacts?

456
31:33.760 --> 31:35.600
I never help anyone expecting a reward.

457
31:36.400 --> 31:40.120
But I suppose there's no harm

458
31:41.200 --> 31:42.160
in getting acquainted.

459
31:46.760 --> 31:48.080
Can I scan your code?

460
31:48.840 --> 31:50.840
Sure. I'll scan yours.

461
31:53.200 --> 31:54.200
There. All done.

462
31:55.880 --> 31:56.960
Thank you again.

463
31:57.040 --> 31:58.440
My pleasure.

464
32:10.680 --> 32:13.920
It's strange. We've only just met,

465
32:14.000 --> 32:16.720
but I feel like I've known you for a long time.

466
32:20.840 --> 32:22.400
Really?

467
32:23.040 --> 32:25.200
I feel the same way.

468
32:32.200 --> 32:34.400
Mom.

469
32:35.040 --> 32:38.400
Your phone keeps buzzing. Who are you texting?

470
32:38.480 --> 32:41.120
Yai. The man I told you about.

471
32:41.200 --> 32:42.640
The one who helped me.

472
32:43.840 --> 32:46.800
What does he look like? I want to see him.

473
32:46.880 --> 32:50.880
He doesn't have any pictures posted. Rich people are like that.

474
32:50.960 --> 32:52.960
They like keeping a low profile.

475
32:53.480 --> 32:56.560
But he's handsome in person.

476
32:57.600 --> 33:00.800
Polite and very well-groomed too.

477
33:00.880 --> 33:02.880
Really, Mom?

478
33:02.960 --> 33:04.920
Are you falling for him?

479
33:05.760 --> 33:08.160
Hey. What are you talking about?

480
33:08.240 --> 33:10.800
We just met.

481
33:10.880 --> 33:12.600
I don't feel anything.

482
33:14.080 --> 33:16.320
You can't judge someone's heart by their face.

483
33:16.400 --> 33:18.560
Be careful who you talk to.

484
33:20.160 --> 33:21.280
I know.

485
33:21.360 --> 33:24.080
Go take a shower. I'll dry your hair afterward.

486
33:24.160 --> 33:25.560
-Okay. -Go.

487
33:25.640 --> 33:26.480
Okay.

488
33:35.120 --> 33:38.360
Talk to you later. I'm about to board my flight.

489
33:38.440 --> 33:40.240
Have a safe trip.

490
33:41.160 --> 33:44.720
I'll send you some beautiful pictures

491
33:44.800 --> 33:47.200
from Switzerland.

492
33:53.680 --> 33:55.240
Sending her a message is enough.

493
33:55.320 --> 33:57.960
Do you really need all those sweet little stickers too?

494
33:58.040 --> 33:59.640
Are you jealous, madam?

495
34:00.680 --> 34:03.960
Are you crazy? You and I are nothing to each other.

496
34:04.040 --> 34:05.360
Why would I be jealous?

497
34:05.440 --> 34:07.280
I'm joking.

498
34:07.800 --> 34:10.880
Don't worry. You can relax.

499
34:10.960 --> 34:13.199
The fish has taken the bait.

500
34:14.000 --> 34:17.040
Good. Make Hathai trust you,

501
34:17.120 --> 34:19.080
then lure her in according to the plan.

502
34:19.159 --> 34:23.320
You don't need to worry about that. My friends run several gambling dens.

503
34:23.400 --> 34:25.760
I'll personally take her there.

504
34:27.719 --> 34:29.960
Make sure she gets buried in gambling debt.

505
34:30.480 --> 34:32.159
I'll handle the rest.

506
34:34.600 --> 34:36.440
-Wait. -What?

507
34:36.520 --> 34:37.560
You're leaving already?

508
34:37.639 --> 34:40.159
Of course. What if someone sees me?

509
34:40.239 --> 34:44.080
And don't show your face around the staff quarters or the main house.

510
34:44.679 --> 34:48.000
Don't let anyone realize you work for me.

511
34:49.400 --> 34:50.800
Understood.

512
35:03.720 --> 35:05.040
Widows

513
35:06.440 --> 35:08.040
can never resist me.

514
35:20.040 --> 35:21.600
-Please vote number one. -Number one.

515
35:21.680 --> 35:24.600
-Thank you. Hello. -Get out!

516
35:24.680 --> 35:27.120
Get out. Get out of here.

517
35:27.200 --> 35:29.480
-Get out. -Calm down.

518
35:29.560 --> 35:32.040
-Get out! Get out of here. -What?

519
35:32.120 --> 35:34.320
Calm down. What happened?

520
35:34.400 --> 35:36.240
You parasitic politicians.

521
35:36.320 --> 35:38.080
That's enough.

522
35:38.160 --> 35:40.800
I'm calling the police and having you all arrested for assault.

523
35:40.880 --> 35:43.880
Call them. Go ahead. I'll report you for buying votes.

524
35:44.960 --> 35:46.200
What are you talking about?

525
35:46.280 --> 35:49.440
You promised to run an honest campaign,

526
35:49.520 --> 35:51.040
but you're buying votes behind us.

527
35:51.720 --> 35:55.000
Raiwin, did you do what he says?

528
35:57.120 --> 36:00.880
No. I promised I wouldn't buy votes.

529
36:01.880 --> 36:04.160
Do you have any evidence that we bought votes?

530
36:04.240 --> 36:06.640
Evidence?

531
36:06.720 --> 36:08.560
Lak is the evidence. He took money from you.

532
36:08.640 --> 36:09.640
Lak.

533
36:10.400 --> 36:12.000
Tell them. Who gave you that money?

534
36:14.720 --> 36:16.240
Please support number one.

535
36:18.960 --> 36:20.160
Number one.

536
36:25.680 --> 36:27.400
NUMBER 2 KRITSADA SIDEE

537
36:29.880 --> 36:31.840
Well…

538
36:31.920 --> 36:33.520
You corrupt politicians.

539
36:33.600 --> 36:36.360
Nothing but fake appearances. Pretending to be good people.

540
36:36.440 --> 36:37.960
Get out.

541
36:38.040 --> 36:40.040
-Get out. -Calm down.

542
36:40.120 --> 36:42.800
-I'm reporting you for vote buying. -Raiwin.

543
36:42.880 --> 36:45.560
Where is Mr. Saksit?

544
36:50.680 --> 36:54.280
You look beautiful today, Ms. Hathai. Where are you going?

545
36:54.360 --> 36:55.760
I have something to take care of.

546
36:56.800 --> 36:58.720
Would you like me to go with you?

547
36:58.800 --> 37:02.160
No. Stay here and help out. Father may need something.

548
37:07.880 --> 37:09.200
-I'm going now. -All right.

549
37:15.800 --> 37:17.720
How did Pong fool her?

550
37:17.800 --> 37:19.720
How did Hathai fall for it so easily?

551
37:21.840 --> 37:24.240
Older widows are all the same.

552
37:24.320 --> 37:27.480
Once they see a handsome man who looks wealthy and successful,

553
37:27.560 --> 37:29.880
they all melt.

554
37:31.960 --> 37:33.560
You too, madam?

555
37:33.640 --> 37:37.240
Are you crazy? I don't go for workers.

556
37:37.320 --> 37:40.480
Madam, workers are still men.

557
37:40.560 --> 37:43.040
And some of them have bodies that are very nice to look at.

558
37:43.120 --> 37:45.080
My mouth is watering.

559
37:46.360 --> 37:50.200
Pong is slippery, though. You need to be careful around him.

560
37:50.280 --> 37:51.840
I know.

561
37:52.360 --> 37:54.480
You always expect the worst from everyone.

562
37:54.560 --> 37:57.240
That attitude is why nobody wants you.

563
38:01.880 --> 38:03.800
I was only trying to help.

564
38:05.400 --> 38:08.080
Honestly, Chamoi, what did I do in a past life

565
38:08.160 --> 38:10.040
to deserve people like this?

566
38:11.040 --> 38:12.160
Please support us.

567
38:12.240 --> 38:15.040
Sorry. Wrong flyer.

568
38:16.880 --> 38:19.400
Ramil. What the hell are you doing?

569
38:19.480 --> 38:23.160
I didn't want to get involved, but what you're doing is illegal. Put it away.

570
38:24.080 --> 38:25.160
Mr. Saksit,

571
38:25.240 --> 38:28.960
do you even realize what you're doing? You're hurting your own son.

572
38:29.040 --> 38:31.680
Me? Hurting him? I'm helping him.

573
38:32.400 --> 38:36.120
You two are unbelievably naive. Do you know that the two of you

574
38:36.200 --> 38:39.320
are going to cost Raiwin the election?

575
38:39.400 --> 38:41.920
You still don't understand that what you're doing is wrong.

576
38:42.520 --> 38:45.640
Wrong? Buying votes is wrong?

577
38:46.520 --> 38:49.520
Look over there. Do you see that? They're everywhere.

578
38:50.600 --> 38:53.040
That's what being a good person gets you.

579
38:54.800 --> 38:58.520
I buy votes because I'm playing the game.

580
38:58.600 --> 39:01.760
This isn't some morality contest.

581
39:01.840 --> 39:04.200
This is a contest measured in money.

582
39:04.280 --> 39:06.400
Record this. They're buying votes.

583
39:08.280 --> 39:09.840
-Get it on video. -Got it.

584
39:10.560 --> 39:11.480
Dad.

585
39:12.600 --> 39:14.840
They're going to go after me. What are you going to do?

586
39:16.880 --> 39:19.280
You have to fix this. Raiwin has to become the Chief.

587
39:22.040 --> 39:25.560
This is nothing. I'll take care of it.

588
39:25.640 --> 39:26.800
Oh.

589
39:26.880 --> 39:29.440
Hello, everyone.

590
39:29.520 --> 39:30.920
Hello.

591
39:31.560 --> 39:33.680
Have you all not received your things yet?

592
39:34.360 --> 39:37.720
I had a delivery rider bring something for everyone.

593
39:37.800 --> 39:38.640
Did you get it?

594
39:39.240 --> 39:42.080
Did you? So you haven't gotten it yet?

595
39:42.960 --> 39:44.960
Here it comes.

596
39:45.040 --> 39:46.160
Here it is.

597
39:46.240 --> 39:47.960
Your food order is here. Open it.

598
39:48.040 --> 39:49.840
Open it. Take a look.

599
39:49.920 --> 39:50.640
NUMBER 1 RAIWIN TRAIPONGRATCHATA

600
39:50.720 --> 39:52.080
Well? Do you like it?

601
39:52.160 --> 39:55.440
Now that you've got your food, enjoy it.

602
39:56.040 --> 39:57.880
Go ahead. Take it.

603
39:59.680 --> 40:01.040
Come on, everyone.

604
40:01.120 --> 40:02.800
-Let's go eat something good. -Thank you.

605
40:02.880 --> 40:05.280
-Hey, wait. My delivery bag. -Come on.

606
40:13.000 --> 40:14.320
Well?

607
40:14.840 --> 40:16.880
I solved the whole problem for you.

608
40:18.040 --> 40:19.160
Learn from this.

609
40:20.040 --> 40:23.440
Money is God. Money can buy anything.

610
40:24.040 --> 40:26.160
But I didn't want to use this method, Dad.

611
40:26.240 --> 40:29.040
Then what method are you going to use?

612
40:29.120 --> 40:31.440
This is what the villagers want.

613
40:31.520 --> 40:33.640
The election is only a few days away.

614
40:33.720 --> 40:37.680
You could walk until your shoes fall apart and nobody would vote for you.

615
40:38.280 --> 40:40.320
At least give me a chance to prove myself.

616
40:44.600 --> 40:48.720
But there really isn't much time left.

617
40:49.240 --> 40:51.120
Do whatever it takes to get into office first.

618
40:51.200 --> 40:53.480
Then prove yourself through your work afterward.

619
40:55.440 --> 40:58.160
I'll do whatever it takes to make sure Raiwin becomes the Chief.

620
40:59.800 --> 41:01.600
If you button the first button wrong,

621
41:02.120 --> 41:04.240
the whole shirt will end up crooked.

622
41:05.680 --> 41:07.440
Money can buy many things,

623
41:08.000 --> 41:10.760
but that dirty money can't buy me.

624
41:11.720 --> 41:13.080
What are you planning to do?

625
41:13.680 --> 41:15.040
I already told you.

626
41:15.560 --> 41:18.600
If you buy votes or break the law,

627
41:18.680 --> 41:20.160
I'll stand against you.

628
41:20.920 --> 41:22.640
Then call. Go ahead.

629
41:22.720 --> 41:24.680
Call the police and have me arrested.

630
41:25.680 --> 41:27.280
Don't challenge me.

631
41:27.880 --> 41:30.760
Really? Ramil.

632
41:31.600 --> 41:34.200
Weren't you the one who said you were going to help Raiwin?

633
41:34.840 --> 41:36.960
And Papang?

634
41:37.560 --> 41:39.560
But if you report this,

635
41:39.640 --> 41:41.560
Raiwin could end up going to prison.

636
41:42.520 --> 41:44.960
I don't know. Go ahead.

637
41:45.040 --> 41:47.360
Call the police. Have them arrest us.

638
41:50.040 --> 41:51.720
But you're the one breaking the law.

639
41:51.800 --> 41:53.080
Not Raiwin.

640
41:54.480 --> 41:55.320
Oh, really?

641
41:55.400 --> 41:57.880
If news about me gets out,

642
41:57.960 --> 41:59.920
think carefully. Do you honestly believe

643
42:00.000 --> 42:02.360
anyone will still vote for Raiwin?

644
42:03.000 --> 42:05.760
It directly affects him.

645
42:09.040 --> 42:11.200
And if you really intend to put me in prison,

646
42:11.280 --> 42:13.200
do you have any witnesses?

647
42:14.080 --> 42:16.160
Go into the community right now.

648
42:16.240 --> 42:19.280
I guarantee not a single villager will testify for you.

649
42:19.840 --> 42:23.920
They've all taken my money.

650
42:24.000 --> 42:26.000
You broke the law

651
42:26.080 --> 42:28.520
and you're still proud of the result?

652
42:30.520 --> 42:32.200
You two really live in a fantasy world.

653
42:32.720 --> 42:34.760
I live in the real world.

654
42:35.680 --> 42:37.320
Get out. Go back

655
42:37.400 --> 42:41.360
to your imaginary perfect world. Go.

656
42:48.520 --> 42:52.480
Here are your flyers. I don't think they'll be of any use to me anymore.

657
43:06.000 --> 43:07.400
We still have much to do.

658
43:08.240 --> 43:09.680
Come on.

659
43:32.040 --> 43:34.560
Have we completely lost hope in politicians?

660
43:35.320 --> 43:36.240
No.

661
43:39.040 --> 43:42.440
I still believe there are good people in this country.

662
43:43.640 --> 43:45.320
Good politicians too.

663
43:49.640 --> 43:53.520
Don't be upset. You did your best.

664
43:56.040 --> 43:57.720
And I'm not giving up either.

665
43:59.240 --> 44:00.560
What are you going to do?

666
44:03.680 --> 44:06.120
No matter who becomes subdistrict chief,

667
44:07.280 --> 44:09.040
I'm going to scrutinize everything they do.

668
44:10.360 --> 44:13.760
I won't let corrupt people steal my tax money.

669
44:16.840 --> 44:18.360
What if that person

670
44:19.320 --> 44:21.520
is Raiwin? Your own brother?

671
44:23.440 --> 44:25.080
If he's really corrupt,

672
44:28.320 --> 44:29.720
I won't let him get away with it.

673
44:40.480 --> 44:42.480
Yai, thank you so much

674
44:42.560 --> 44:44.520
for having lunch with me today.

675
44:46.080 --> 44:47.360
It's my pleasure.

676
44:47.440 --> 44:50.320
I came straight here to see you as soon as I got off the plane.

677
44:52.360 --> 44:56.040
Actually, I wanted to bring you a designer handbag,

678
44:56.120 --> 44:58.640
but I had to look after the minister's family,

679
44:58.720 --> 45:00.800
so I didn't have any personal time.

680
45:00.880 --> 45:01.960
Here.

681
45:03.280 --> 45:07.200
I brought you a few small things. Some clothes

682
45:07.280 --> 45:08.800
and chocolates. I hope you like them.

683
45:09.720 --> 45:11.440
Thank you so much.

684
45:11.520 --> 45:13.720
Next time, I won't forget.

685
45:13.800 --> 45:16.160
I promise I'll bring you a designer handbag.

686
45:16.760 --> 45:18.120
That's really not necessary.

687
45:18.200 --> 45:21.600
Just thinking of me and bringing something is enough.

688
45:24.800 --> 45:25.880
Hathai.

689
45:26.440 --> 45:29.840
Do you have anywhere to go after this?

690
45:32.320 --> 45:35.920
No. I don't have anything else planned.

691
45:36.000 --> 45:39.440
Whenever I come back from a trip, I like to relax

692
45:39.520 --> 45:42.600
and hang out with friends.

693
45:42.680 --> 45:44.800
Would you like to come with me?

694
45:47.920 --> 45:51.080
Where are you going, Yai?

695
46:09.640 --> 46:10.520
Come in.

696
46:20.160 --> 46:22.000
I like to relax here.

697
46:28.760 --> 46:31.400
Everyone in here is a friend of mine.

698
46:33.000 --> 46:36.200
When we get time, we come here to drink and gamble a little to relieve stress.

699
46:36.280 --> 46:38.040
Please come in, Hathai.

700
46:40.200 --> 46:42.840
I'm sorry.

701
46:42.920 --> 46:44.240
Are you disgusted by me?

702
46:45.440 --> 46:48.520
No, I'm not. It's just…

703
46:50.720 --> 46:54.360
I promised my daughter

704
46:54.440 --> 46:56.160
I wouldn't gamble anymore.

705
46:56.920 --> 46:59.480
Your daughter sounds wonderful.

706
46:59.560 --> 47:01.080
She really cares about her mother.

707
47:02.080 --> 47:03.560
How about this?

708
47:04.160 --> 47:05.880
I promise

709
47:05.960 --> 47:10.000
I'll keep it secret. I won't tell your daughter.

710
47:18.160 --> 47:19.120
Come on.

711
47:22.200 --> 47:25.080
I'm really sorry.

712
47:25.160 --> 47:27.040
I don't want to disappoint my daughter.

713
47:29.480 --> 47:31.480
And you're not afraid of disappointing me?

714
47:37.960 --> 47:39.000
Hathai.

715
47:39.520 --> 47:42.160
I've never brought another woman here.

716
47:42.920 --> 47:45.120
I consider this place private.

717
47:48.680 --> 47:50.880
I only bring someone here if she's special to me.

718
47:53.880 --> 47:54.880
Come inside.

719
47:59.880 --> 48:00.800
Please.

720
48:02.280 --> 48:03.720
I'm really sorry.

721
48:10.960 --> 48:12.120
Pong.

722
48:13.320 --> 48:16.680
You got her all the way to the den. Why did you let her leave?

723
48:16.760 --> 48:20.320
I want her drowning in debt. Then she'll start stealing and selling off her stuff.

724
48:20.400 --> 48:23.520
After that, Father will throw her out. Do you understand?

725
48:23.600 --> 48:27.200
I did everything I could, madam. I tried convincing her. I flirted with her.

726
48:27.280 --> 48:29.840
Nothing worked. Try to understand.

727
48:31.240 --> 48:33.000
If you can't do it, then stop making excuses.

728
48:33.080 --> 48:34.760
You really are useless.

729
48:34.840 --> 48:36.200
I'll have to find someone else.

730
48:36.280 --> 48:39.080
-Hey. Wait, madam. -What now?

731
48:39.160 --> 48:42.280
Give me another chance. Do you know

732
48:43.080 --> 48:45.080
I even went to a spa.

733
48:45.160 --> 48:47.400
I had my entire body scrubbed.

734
48:47.920 --> 48:49.680
My skin is smooth, and I smell great.

735
48:50.400 --> 48:53.560
If you don't believe me,

736
48:54.280 --> 48:55.840
you can feel for yourself.

737
48:55.920 --> 48:58.120
Actually, I'd like you

738
48:59.240 --> 49:00.360
to feel my whole body.

739
49:02.200 --> 49:03.520
Start here…

740
49:06.280 --> 49:09.320
Hm? Why did you stop?

741
49:25.000 --> 49:26.800
You messed up this time.

742
49:26.880 --> 49:30.040
Next time, don't let your catch get away.

743
49:30.120 --> 49:31.400
NEXT EPISODE

744
49:31.480 --> 49:34.640
Do you know why I still have feelings for you?

745
49:34.720 --> 49:37.040
Because you care about other people's feelings.

746
49:37.120 --> 49:39.200
You're with Chayanee.

747
49:44.120 --> 49:45.560
Chayanee, stop!

748
49:45.640 --> 49:47.560
Stop thinking only about yourself.

749
49:47.640 --> 49:49.640
Think about me for once.

750
49:49.720 --> 49:50.760
Then,

751
49:51.280 --> 49:54.680
I'll put a cold compress on it for you.

752
51:46.440 --> 51:51.480
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
